Fork changes
============

Adapted for DeepSeek V4.1 Flash: the target model identifiers, the removal of
the GPT-backed image description step, credential separation on the DeepSeek
route, reasoning-effort pass-through, the catalog template preference, and a
cross-platform fix to the generated Windows PowerShell path.

"DeepSeek" is a trademark of DeepSeek; "ChatGPT", "Codex" and "OpenAI" are
trademarks of OpenAI. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by either
company. It only wires the locally installed Codex client to the DeepSeek API
using credentials the user supplies.

Files under `assets/` are the upstream project's artwork, carried over
unmodified for attribution.
